    "description": "<b><font color=\"\u201d#00ccff\u201d\">BUY ONE GET ONE OFFER!</font></b>\r\nhttps://sites.google.com/view/shardsbogo?usp=sharing\r\n\r\n<b>All watch faces:</b> https://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=7427443638746033211\r\n\r\n<b>The SH098 is a Digital watch face for Wear OS by Shards.</b>\r\nShards is the perfect choice of watch faces for Wear OS smartwatches. Analog, digital, hybrid watch faces for your watch.\r\n\r\n<b>Watch face installation notes on smart watch:</b>\r\nPhone app serves only as a placeholder to make it easier to install & find the watch face on your Wear OS watch. You have to select your watch device from the install dropdown menu\r\n\r\n<b>TELEGRAM:</b>\r\nhttps://t.me/joinchat/TxsjXaUXKMQgqn5N \r\n\r\n<b>FACEBOOK:</b>\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/groups/655756995056226/?ref=share\r\n\r\n<b>INSTAGRAM:</b>\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/shards_watch_face \r\n\r\nWatch face features:\r\n- Digital time(12/24h)\r\n- Day of the week\r\n- Date\r\n- Month\r\n- Steps *\r\n- Battery %\r\n- Customizable shortcuts\r\n- Preset Shortcuts\r\n- Customizable field / complications\r\n- Always On Display\r\n- Changeable colors\r\n- Unread notifications on device\r\n- Distance *, **\r\n* Shows the value of the sensors(Steps/Distance) in turn - 5 seconds. In AOD mode, only the number of steps taken is displayed.\r\n** Mileage will automatically show on devices with language set to UK and US English. For other languages, the distance will be shown in KM.\r\n\r\nWatch face customization:\r\n1 - Touch and hold display\r\n2 - Tap on customize option\r\n\r\nSome features may not be available on some watches.\r\nNot Suitable for Rectangular Watches.\r\n\r\n<b> This watch face supports all Wear OS devices with API Level 30+ </b>\r\n\r\n<b>All watch faces:</b> https://play.google.com/store/apps/dev?id=7427443638746033211",
